    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1924820/extras/f0309d8a8318659204956c2f98208ad3.poster.avif?t=1725108513\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1924820/extras/f0309d8a8318659204956c2f98208ad3.webm?t=1725108513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1924820/extras/f0309d8a8318659204956c2f98208ad3.mp4?t=1725108513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2><strong>An entire generation of StudioS characters all fighting to be #1!</strong><br><br>Fight your way to the top with satisfying and easy to execute combos!<br>A unique retro-style game inspired by 90s era handheld fighting games!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Character Roster</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1924820/extras/e0f950a14dee7c2da4170d9a4dce5a8f.avif?t=1725108513\" /></div><br>Strip Fighter: Yuki, Mari, Archincubus<br>BATTLE SLAVE: Saya, S<br>Hunter's Edge: Seria<br>Galaxy Gunners: Mika<br>Acme Iku: Iku Acme<br>MONMUSU\uff0aFIGHT: Mayreau<br>Slave Princess Sarah: Sarah<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Tag-Team system keeps the action rolling!</h2>Call support characters into a fight and carry out double team attacks!<br><br>Time your tag-ins just right...and turn the battle in your favor!!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Easy to pick simple fighting game controlls.<br></li><li>Tag-Team fighting made up of 10 teams of 20 fun and unique characters. <br></li><li>A plethora of comical and outrageous attack animations<br></li><li>Story Mode where you can play against CPU<br></li><li>Versus Mode that allows you to play as any character<br></li><li>Practice Mode you can use to hone your skills</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> DirectPlay must be installed in order to play this game</h2>DirectPlay is required to play this game.<br><br>If DirectPlay is not installed on your computer, you will be prompted to install it when the game is launched for the first time.<br><br>If you cancel the DirectPlay installation or if it does not install correctly, please follow the below steps to activate it:<br>1. Press Windows Key + R.<br>2.Type &quot;appwiz.cpl&quot; in the text box and press enter.<br>3. Click on &quot;Turn Windows features on or off&quot;.<br>4. Check &quot;Legacy Components &gt;DirectPlay.",
